{"unit_id":"Hua1Q1nG__dsh-prompt-self#feature-1","repo":"Hua1Q1nG/dsh-prompt-self","commit":"aac7d4206a0f17a6cc5cf392408ee617f495fb6f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-self 的功能「根据画像自动改写」：收到真实用户请求时读取个人画像，通过 DSH 模型改写表达、补足画像中记录的约束，并把优化文本注入当前对话；画像为空或优化未产生变化时跳过。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:598-690"]}
{"unit_id":"Hua1Q1nG__dsh-prompt-self#feature-2","repo":"Hua1Q1nG/dsh-prompt-self","commit":"aac7d4206a0f17a6cc5cf392408ee617f495fb6f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-self 的功能「每轮自动学习」：每次 turn/end 后分析最近一组真实请求和最终回答，提取习惯与防误解规则，合并到核心画像及独立学习记录文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:310-320"]}
{"unit_id":"Hua1Q1nG__dsh-prompt-self#feature-3","repo":"Hua1Q1nG/dsh-prompt-self","commit":"aac7d4206a0f17a6cc5cf392408ee617f495fb6f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-self 的功能「个人画像设置页与输入坞」：Web 设置页展示习惯、规则和学习记录，可切换自动改写与自动学习；对话输入框的快捷入口显示状态并打开同一画像面板。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:146-221"]}
{"unit_id":"Hua1Q1nG__dsh-prompt-self#feature-4","repo":"Hua1Q1nG/dsh-prompt-self","commit":"aac7d4206a0f17a6cc5cf392408ee617f495fb6f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-self 的功能「手动立即学习」：用户发送 -fin 时，插件跳过改写并强制分析此前最近一组请求与回答，作为关闭自动学习时的手动触发方式。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:659-670"]}
